    "$t": "Lán來講看māi - 三種台語拼音書寫系統"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p>&nbsp;</p><h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: x-large;\">《三種台語拼音書寫系統</span></h2><h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: x-large;\">—臺羅、白話字、方音符號kah國際音標ê對照》</span></h2><h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">/Ia̍p Khái-sîng</span></h2><div><span><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; font-size: large; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEgKCdS_3rgPAuFsusRQI0Hs_7c7URT28SsPALdAkgnLdRwVBA0qxvX21XS7tKteMkL5CS3zO-SswRtpzOJqKeMVl-Ym2EnDA7YY5TJLzqj3s3XwJN44DyJEyBpxz_0iCTw65GgvV1fxIDkAVR-T0FP0gDfkqf2VFKwwwmuyyUb8XmYqlttIx9u7IiFxxPcV\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; font-size: large; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEgKCdS_3rgPAuFsusRQI0Hs_7c7URT28SsPALdAkgnLdRwVBA0qxvX21XS7tKteMkL5CS3zO-SswRtpzOJqKeMVl-Ym2EnDA7YY5TJLzqj3s3XwJN44DyJEyBpxz_0iCTw65GgvV1fxIDkAVR-T0FP0gDfkqf2VFKwwwmuyyUb8XmYqlttIx9u7IiFxxPcV\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEirDi99ULyq90MyUmBgAFA2my1hiJIYtKgihh6ohshkfYg8KqsQm1iZbt3abT42mBBCH8kbQGLj6UMPGeO6Fl1A3zreAzzRTApGmfgAi-nqmFOKyP0H1TrxVIPLljkLl_xrkRpnmiXBkL-xMNuv7I4JIAclXYJF4PIC3b04sSmKM3vP2yERt-BR7f1ZPmjR\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img data-original-height=\"6071\" data-original-width=\"4299\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEirDi99ULyq90MyUmBgAFA2my1hiJIYtKgihh6ohshkfYg8KqsQm1iZbt3abT42mBBCH8kbQGLj6UMPGeO6Fl1A3zreAzzRTApGmfgAi-nqmFOKyP0H1TrxVIPLljkLl_xrkRpnmiXBkL-xMNuv7I4JIAclXYJF4PIC3b04sSmKM3vP2yERt-BR7f1ZPmjR=w453-h640\" width=\"453\" /></a></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; font-size: large; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEjHNa-jAaRgUfhqWoWXimqU-YDZGm9GbCcST_a1WH9NknjsZ5X_NA_iA5KFCPmYUtKsR0zHuHr1o-8qsSd